# Flavors of Our Lives (adoulin 46), the SoA rival at Masad: a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin, SoA current
# The Man in Black (51, a GM: its Masad handler plays 134, an Event, without the Card Jailer Teodor), the quest accepted
# (a GM). Masad's order line: Mission[12][11], Mission[12][51], Mission[12][52], then the quest. Prog 0: 83 (a
# progressEvent) over the mission's 134; SoA 51 is past Budding Prospects: no mission var, only the quest's Timer 8001;
# finished: Prog 1. Prog 1, the Timer 8001 (to come): 104 (a progressEvent) over 134. The Timer 8000 (today, a GM): 104
# (an Event, once per zone) and 134 tie: the first in container order plays (the mission's 134), finished on 1:
# The Man in Black completed (To the Victor's Status 1), SoA To the Victor (52, the same 134 at Masad); then 104 (the
# rotation); then 134 twice (104 spent in this zone visit; To the Victor's 134 finish on 1 does nothing).
lists WesternAdoulin/Masad/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/83
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=-26.682,-0.65,-91.991 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Soa TheManInBlack current
quest Adoulin.FlavorsOfOurLives accepted
login
trigger Masad                           # Prog 0: 83 over the mission's 134; the quest's Timer 8001
finish                                  # Prog 1
trigger Masad                           # Prog 1, the Timer 8001 (to come): 104 (a progressEvent) over 134
finish
charvar Quest[9][46]Timer 8000          # a GM: the Timer today
trigger Masad                           # 104 (an Event, once per zone) and 134 tie: 134 (the mission's, first)
finish option=1                         # The Man in Black completed: SoA To the Victor (Status 1)
trigger Masad                           # the rotation: 104
finish option=1
trigger Masad                           # 104 spent in this zone visit: To the Victor's 134
finish option=1                         # To the Victor: option 1 does nothing
trigger Masad                           # 134 again
finish option=1
